{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a17c09e4b36d5f82",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## Multivariate Gaussian distributions\n\nStart with the joint definition, then follow fixed transformations, conditional distributions, independence, density and distance calibration.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n从联合定义进入变换、条件化、独立性与距离；诊断用于检查模型和数据是否相容。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "3f18b7c2a9d46e05",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[联合Gaussian|Joint Gaussian distributions]]\n\nEvery fixed real linear combination is univariate Gaussian, including zero-variance constants.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n全部固定实线性组合均为一元正态；允许半正定协方差与退化分布。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c2e51f0d7a4396b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gaussian仿射闭包|Gaussian affine transformations]]\n\nFor jointly Gaussian $X$, fixed compatible real $A,b$ give Gaussian $AX+b$. Rectangular maps, repeated coordinates and singular covariance are allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n取边际是选择坐标的特例；均值、协方差变换进一步确定完整Gaussian律。",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4b9061c2d7f5a83",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gaussian条件分布|Conditional Gaussian distributions]]\n\nFor jointly Gaussian blocks $(X_1,X_2)$ with invertible $\\operatorname{Cov}(X_2)$, a Gaussian conditional version has a mean affine in $x_2$ and a fixed positive-semidefinite covariance.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n要求被观测块可逆；整个协方差与条件协方差都可以奇异。",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "6d3a8f21c0b497e5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[联合高斯独立判据|Gaussian independence criterion]]\n\nFor jointly Gaussian blocks, zero cross-covariance is equivalent to independence, including singular blocks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n联合Gaussian时，零交叉协方差等价于块独立；仅有正态边际不够。",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b52f7d90a1c638e4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gaussian密度与奇异支撑|Gaussian density and support]]\n\nFor Gaussian $X$ with mean $\\mu$ and covariance $\\Sigma$, a density in the ambient space exists iff $\\Sigma$ is positive definite. Otherwise support is $\\mu+\\operatorname{range}(\\Sigma)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正定才有全维密度；奇异时支撑是低维仿射子空间，秩零时为一点。",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "09e6c1b3f8a4725d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gaussian马氏平方律|Gaussian squared-distance law]]\n\nFor $X\\sim N_p(\\mu,\\Sigma)$ using the true mean and positive-definite covariance, $(X-\\mu)^T\\Sigma^{-1}(X-\\mu)\\sim\\chi_p^2$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n白化后为p个独立标准正态平方和。奇异协方差须使用伪逆和秩；拟合参数须另行校准。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe underlying geometry is [[马氏距离|Mahalanobis distance]].\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7a320d5c9841e6b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[联合Gaussian诊断|Assessing a joint Gaussian model]]\n\nCheck the sampling structure, margins, selected projections and fitted distances, then assess consequences for the intended calculation. The fitted-distance chi-square plot is an approximate reference. Investigate unusual observations in their source records.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先核对观测对象与抽样，再综合图形及实际结论的敏感性。拟合距离的卡方图只是近似参照。",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c81d9a6e2f735b0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[边际与马氏图不证联合Gaussian|Limits of diagnostic plots]]\n\nNormal margins do not establish joint Gaussianity. Distances discard directions, and fitting a common mean and covariance changes their reference law.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n边际、有限投影与半径各有信息损失；未检出偏离不能证明整个总体模型。",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0018-cf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[特征函数|Characteristic functions]]\n\nThe whole function $\\varphi_X(t)=E[e^{it^TX}]$ determines the joint law. For Gaussian vectors, its exponent uses only the mean $\\mu$ and covariance $\\Sigma$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n不需要密度或协方差可逆，因而也能证明退化Gaussian的分布结论。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0019-chi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[卡方分布|Chi-square distribution]]\n\nFor a positive integer $k$, the sum of $k$ independent standard-normal squares has law $\\chi_k^2$. Its mean is $k$ and variance is $2k$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n自由度数独立的标准正态平方项；复制同一个随机变量不能增加独立项。"
    }
  ],
